R CMD check --as-cran PORTO_0.1.0.tar.gz
R CMD Rd2pdf --output=PORTO-reference.pdf PORTO
\end{verbatim}
The distributed PDF follows the layout of standard CRAN manuals (metadata, contents, alphabetical function topics, arguments, value, examples and index). Its standalone LaTeX source is independently compilable. The package's Rd files are the native source for R's own reference-manual generator. See \url{https://cran.r-project.org/doc/manuals/R-exts.html}.
